    "updated_at": "2021-07-15T23:44:04Z",
    "body": "Note that @mnot raised this specifically for *source* ports, whereas the blocklist in the spec exists for *destination* ports.  It's really important to be clear on this point.\r\n\r\nI know that @annevk already has designs on unifying the port number blocklist for destination ports, but the introduction of a blocklist for source ports is new and likely unique to UDP.",
